253
00:16:24,760 --> 00:16:27,660
We shell about 25 tons an hour of peanuts.

254
00:16:28,160 --> 00:16:31,020
Takes about a truckload an hour to supply this plant.

255
00:16:31,021 --> 00:16:36,020
The peanuts that make the grade are bagged and sent to

