266
00:17:20,841 --> 00:17:27,840
oil. At Golden Peanut, they press 350

267
00:17:27,841 --> 00:17:33,840
tons of peanuts each day. George Washington Carver's work

268
00:17:33,841 --> 00:17:38,840
with the peanut in the early 1900s became the foundation for

269
00:17:38,841 --> 00:17:43,840
a new science known as chemergy, the process of discovering

