271
00:17:48,841 --> 00:17:53,840
Using peanuts, sweet potatoes, soybeans, and other crops, he

272
00:17:53,841 --> 00:17:57,840
literally planted the seed for technological innovations that

273
00:17:57,841 --> 00:18:02,840
would change the course of farming in the United States.

274
00:18:06,840 --> 00:18:10,840
In 1921, Carver was invited to testify at a congressional

275
00:18:10,841 --> 00:18:13,840
hearing for a proposed tariff on peanuts.

276
00:18:13,841 --> 00:18:17,840
He was allotted 10 minutes, but congressmen were so impressed by

277
00:18:17,841 --> 00:18:20,840
so impressed by Carver's testimony that he was allowed

278
00:18:20,841 --> 00:18:24,840
