279
00:18:24,841 --> 00:18:28,840
George Washington Carver Tech will return on Modern Marvels.

280
00:18:33,840 --> 00:18:36,840
We now return to George Washington Carver Tech on

281
00:18:36,841 --> 00:18:42,840
Modern Marvels. George Washington Carver's

282
00:18:42,841 --> 00:18:46,840
enduring influence is evident in a diverse array of products that

