00:18:54,041 --> 00:18:59,080
solvents, and even a new vodka are some of the items that can

285
00:18:59,081 --> 00:19:02,520
be traced to his experiments with another soil-enriching and

286
00:19:02,521 --> 00:19:08,760
protein-rich crop, the soybean. We work in plastics,

287
00:19:08,761 --> 00:19:13,240
adhesives, in lubricants, so it's really a whole realm of new

