00:19:13,241 --> 00:19:16,340
products from that technology.

289
00:19:16,440 --> 00:19:19,140
Carver learned that the oil from soybeans is composed of

290
00:19:19,240 --> 00:19:23,680
five fatty acids and that the bean itself is naturally rich

291
00:19:23,780 --> 00:19:26,780
