292
00:19:26,880 --> 00:19:29,720
You have a bean that has a lot of oil in it

293
00:19:29,820 --> 00:19:33,500
and a lot of protein, and it can be crushed and separated,

294
00:19:33,600 --> 00:19:37,700
and things can happen to that little bean.

295
00:19:37,800 --> 00:19:40,600
When Carver looked at the soybean under the microscope,

296
00:19:40,601 --> 00:19:43,600
He saw that the oil had chemical properties that would allow it

297
00:19:43,700 --> 00:19:46,940
