00:19:50,240 --> 00:19:52,940
There's a lot of carbons in a row, 13, 16 carbons.

300
00:19:53,040 --> 00:19:57,120
And so that gives it ability to be a very flexible type of oil

301
00:19:57,220 --> 00:19:58,380
to be used.

302
00:19:58,480 --> 00:20:03,660
And it's also relatively inexpensive as an oil.

303
00:20:03,760 --> 00:20:07,160
Carver's early experiments resulted in food products.

304
00:20:07,260 --> 00:20:09,860
Soy mayonnaise was one of his first successes.

305
00:20:09,861 --> 00:20:13,360
He said he started work with the soybean around 1903.

306
00:20:13,460 --> 00:20:16,160
And by the time they'd finished that phase of the work,

307
00:20:16,260 --> 00:20:18,860
