00:21:16,120 --> 00:21:19,560
Ford shared Carver's passion for developing new uses for farm

323
00:21:19,660 --> 00:21:24,080
products, and he was a major player in the Khmergy movement.

324
00:21:24,180 --> 00:21:27,000
And he was really taken by the fact that Carver could take

325
00:21:27,100 --> 00:21:33,440
soybean, for example, and come up with components of car parts.

326
00:21:33,540 --> 00:21:35,340
You look at a guy like Henry Ford,

327
00:21:35,341 --> 00:21:38,220
Henry Ford, who had tremendous resources.

328
00:21:38,221 --> 00:21:41,240
And he was always looking for the newest and the brightest

329
00:21:41,241 --> 00:21:42,840
and looking for other opportunities.

330
00:21:42,841 --> 00:21:44,460
And he saw this man, Carver, and he

331
00:21:44,461 --> 00:21:47,460
saw him as just a gold mine, a wealth of information

332
00:21:47,461 --> 00:21:51,040
and a wealth of creativity and really

