00:21:52,801 --> 00:21:55,100
And Carver was not drawn by the money,

335
00:21:55,101 --> 00:21:56,580
not drawn by the opportunity.

336
00:21:56,581 --> 00:21:59,640
He knew that his job was to be there at Tuskegee,

337
00:21:59,641 --> 00:22:02,040
to teach, to guide.

338
00:22:02,041 --> 00:22:04,460
Despite his devotion to Tuskegee,

339
00:22:04,461 --> 00:22:07,460
continued to personally consult with Ford about his ongoing

340
00:22:07,461 --> 00:22:14,460
research in soy plastics. In 1942, the automaker unveiled

