00:22:14,461 --> 00:22:19,460
a car that included a bushel of soy in its construction.

342
00:22:19,461 --> 00:22:23,460
The gear shift knob, the door crank handles, the foot pedals,

343
00:22:23,461 --> 00:22:27,460
things like that. Mr. Ford had nearly 7,000 acres

344
00:22:27,461 --> 00:22:30,460
of soybeans grown right there in that area.

345
00:22:30,461 --> 00:22:33,460
He had the research labs right there that he worked in, and he

346
00:22:33,461 --> 00:22:37,300
and he tied that with industry in his plan of building

347
00:22:37,400 --> 00:22:41,860
automobiles. In a rare film from 1943,

348
00:22:41,960 --> 00:22:45,000
the Ford Motor Company revealed a car that had some body parts

