00:23:10,521 --> 00:23:15,520
Built in 2003, this concept car's interior is made entirely from an

355
00:23:15,521 --> 00:23:23,640
eco-friendly, recyclable polyester with soy-based seats and tailgate.

356
00:23:23,641 --> 00:23:26,640
While the Ford Motor Company carries on Carver's belief in the

357
00:23:26,641 --> 00:23:30,640
potential. So do scientists at Iowa State

