00:23:36,641 --> 00:23:39,640
primarily with the oil from the soybean, they focused on soy

360
00:23:39,641 --> 00:23:43,640
flour. They've used the flour to

361
00:23:43,641 --> 00:23:46,640
develop a breakthrough formula for producing a new variety of

362
00:23:46,641 --> 00:23:55,640
durable plastic. Soybean farmers around the

363
00:23:55,641 --> 00:23:58,280
are well aware of Carver's early research

364
00:23:58,380 --> 00:24:00,080
and the potential of using soybeans

365
00:24:00,180 --> 00:24:01,380
in commercial products.

366
00:24:03,680 --> 00:24:07,380
George Washington Carver discovered years ago

367
00:24:07,480 --> 00:24:10,080
that there was this multitude of products

