00:25:19,600 --> 00:25:22,700
The application of it is very simple, very easy to do.

386
00:25:22,701 --> 00:25:27,000
And it will save us energy by reducing our heating and cooling

387
00:25:27,100 --> 00:25:30,700
costs in the building. In the 1940s,

388
00:25:30,800 --> 00:25:34,040
the soybeans' greatest champion had gained world renown as a

389
00:25:34,140 --> 00:25:37,840
scientific pioneer. But George Washington Carver

390
00:25:37,940 --> 00:25:41,760
remained a simple man. Although he was the head of the

391
00:25:41,860 --> 00:25:44,960
Agricultural College at Tuskegee, when he went out to

392
00:25:45,060 --> 00:25:50,300
the farms to teach, people often mistook him for a hired hand.

393
00:25:50,301 --> 00:25:53,600
But his trademark rumpled suit was never without some sort

