00:25:53,700 --> 00:25:56,500
of fresh flower or weed in the lapel,

395
00:25:56,600 --> 00:25:59,500
a symbol of his love for nature.

396
00:25:59,600 --> 00:26:03,140
Carver was a curious character.

397
00:26:03,240 --> 00:26:06,960
He cared nothing for his outer appearance.

398
00:26:07,060 --> 00:26:09,820
When he was going on speaking tours, if somebody said he ought

