00:26:19,201 --> 00:26:23,440
Carver never married and professed to be completely fulfilled by his work.

403
00:26:23,441 --> 00:26:28,640
Another thing he said about a wife was, what woman would want a husband forever dropping

404
00:26:28,641 --> 00:26:31,382
