477
00:31:44,881 --> 00:31:47,580
In just five years, the biodiesel industry

478
00:31:47,581 --> 00:31:50,580
has gone from research and development

479
00:31:50,581 --> 00:31:55,080
to the open road. It has been tested over 50 million

480
00:31:55,081 --> 00:31:58,080
