481
00:31:58,081 --> 00:32:01,620
Now there are more than 500 commercial fleets using various

482
00:32:01,621 --> 00:32:04,820
blends of biodiesel, including all four major branches of the

483
00:32:04,821 --> 00:32:11,040
military, federal government fleets, municipal fleets.

484
00:32:11,041 --> 00:32:13,700
George Washington Carver was not only a pioneer in the

485
00:32:13,701 --> 00:32:17,700
biodiesel field, he also took some of the first steps into the

486
00:32:17,701 --> 00:32:21,700
