487
00:32:21,800 --> 00:32:24,500
Carver created hybrids with the flowers and plants in his

488
00:32:24,600 --> 00:32:28,640
laboratory by painstakingly crossing two specimens and waiting

489
00:32:28,740 --> 00:32:31,540
patiently for the results.

